1
00:02:02,554 --> 00:02:04,554


2
00:02:04,578 --> 00:02:05,968
I feel it, I feel it!

3
00:02:08,726 --> 00:02:11,398
I've finally found her!

4
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,540
Well, aren't we pretentious.

5
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:28,500
It's him!

6
00:02:28,609 --> 00:02:30,027
He's the one who did it!

7
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:41,580
I'm telling you to pay your taxes!

8
00:02:41,605 --> 00:02:43,160
We don't have a single yen left.

9
00:02:43,185 --> 00:02:45,720
Alright, so you refuse to pay your taxes no matter what, huh?

10
00:02:45,745 --> 00:02:47,540
Have mercy...

11
00:02:50,174 --> 00:02:52,456
You still claim you don't have a single yen even after this?

12
00:02:53,019 --> 00:02:55,612
But if you take that, we'll...

13
00:02:55,636 --> 00:02:56,260
Shut up!

14
00:02:56,285 --> 00:02:57,975
That's none of our concern!

15
00:02:58,620 --> 00:03:00,360
You guys are Duralumin's henchmen, aren't you?

16
00:03:00,554 --> 00:03:04,000
That's right, we are Grand Duke Duralumin's tax collection squad!

17
00:03:04,435 --> 00:03:06,604
Stop taking taxes from poor people!

18
00:03:06,984 --> 00:03:08,140
Mind your own business!

19
00:03:08,165 --> 00:03:09,200
Who the hell are you?!

20
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:10,840
I am Prince Sapphire!

21
00:03:11,555 --> 00:03:13,071
Prince Sapphire, you say?

22
00:03:13,350 --> 00:03:15,139
As if there's a prince dressed in such rags!

23
00:03:15,164 --> 00:03:17,400
There's no way a prince would be walking around alone!

24
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:19,360
He's just some crazy brat, get him!

25
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,520
Leave it to me!

26
00:03:22,014 --> 00:03:23,014
You idiot!

27
00:03:23,210 --> 00:03:24,210
The one you're supposed to beat up is him!

28
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,000
No, no!

29
00:03:30,140 --> 00:03:30,900
The enemy is over there!

30
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,240
You fool, I told you to stop!

31
00:03:32,300 --> 00:03:33,920
Don't laugh, kid!

32
00:03:34,524 --> 00:03:36,020
I've had enough of you!

33
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:39,190
Alright, I'll take you on!

34
00:03:39,285 --> 00:03:40,400
Come at me all at once!

35
00:03:42,580 --> 00:03:43,680
Pay these taxes!

36
00:03:44,584 --> 00:03:46,820
If you don't pay, I'll throw you in jail!

37
00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:05,740
Damn it!

38
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:07,000
We did it!

39
00:04:07,060 --> 00:04:07,860
Deliver the finishing blow!

40
00:04:08,049 --> 00:04:09,049
Are you trying to make a fool of me?!

41
00:04:12,901 --> 00:04:15,941
You are chasing me again!

42
00:04:29,550 --> 00:04:32,200
I'm going to report everything you did to my father!

43
00:04:33,085 --> 00:04:34,085
Your Highness!

44
00:04:34,645 --> 00:04:37,000
It's dinner time!

45
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:38,400
Oh?

46
00:04:41,260 --> 00:04:42,260
Opal!

47
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,820
Prince Sapphire!

48
00:04:47,985 --> 00:04:49,800
Please forgive the rudeness of my men!

49
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:50,960
Yes, sir!

50
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,700
Nylon!

51
00:04:52,780 --> 00:04:54,520
Return all the taxes you collected right now!

52
00:04:54,900 --> 00:04:55,250
My goodness!

53
00:04:55,275 --> 00:04:56,859
It is precisely because of these taxes...

54
00:04:56,883 --> 00:04:58,820
that you are able to live such a splendid life, Your Highness!

55
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,080
I don't want those kinds of taxes!

56
00:05:00,340 --> 00:05:00,740
Return them!

57
00:05:01,555 --> 00:05:03,040
Very well, I will do as you say, Your Highness!

58
00:05:05,020 --> 00:05:05,340
Hmph!

59
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,840
That damn prince, getting so full of himself!

60
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:07,617
Hey!

61
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:08,540
You spineless cowards!

62
00:05:08,840 --> 00:05:10,260
Hurry up and collect the taxes!

63
00:05:10,490 --> 00:05:12,683
Tell them Prince Sapphire wants a vacation home!

64
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:14,060
Taxes!

65
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:15,860
We're building a villa for the Prince!

66
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,260
What are you standing around for?!

67
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:29,760
Hurry up and go collect those taxes!

68
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,240
Hecate!

69
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,180
At last, I have found the girl we were looking for!

70
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,063
A girl?

71
00:05:50,435 --> 00:05:51,740
You mean a prince, Papa!

72
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:52,880
Ahahaha!

73
00:05:53,300 --> 00:05:54,460
Once every 2000 years,

74
00:05:54,485 --> 00:05:56,415
due to a mistake in Heaven, a child is born

75
00:05:56,439 --> 00:05:58,880
a girl yet possessing the heart of a boy!

76
00:05:58,935 --> 00:06:01,050
Oh, poor thing...

77
00:06:01,075 --> 00:06:06,120
If we extract the boy's heart from that girl and put it into you, you will become a splendid witch!

78
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:07,940
Vastness of Hell!

79
00:06:08,344 --> 00:06:10,600
Celebrate my daughter Hecate!

80
00:06:15,981 --> 00:06:19,700
O Wind, O Thunder, sing the song of thunder!

81
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:27,480
Ah, Hecate, you too... Huh?

82
00:06:28,130 --> 00:06:29,540
Hecate, where are you?

83
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:42,760
Papa is being so selfish.

84
00:06:43,218 --> 00:06:44,920
I'm fine just the way I am, though.

85
00:06:45,205 --> 00:06:46,205
Hey, little bird?

86
00:06:47,940 --> 00:06:50,600
Hecate, what is the Demon King's daughter doing acting like that?

87
00:06:51,020 --> 00:06:53,560
Turn a flower like that into something hideous!

88
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:55,580
Safin!

89
00:06:56,890 --> 00:06:59,060
Who turns it into their Papa's face?!

90
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:01,020
Come on, try summoning a storm!

91
00:07:01,021 --> 00:07:02,240
Lightning!

92
00:07:04,955 --> 00:07:05,955
Wind!

93
00:07:08,005 --> 00:07:09,005
Water!

94
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:14,740
I can't do it like Papa... There's no need to cry, Hecate.

95
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:16,661
You'll become a great witch soon, too.

96
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:19,200
Then you can even get into the Magic Academy.

97
00:07:19,685 --> 00:07:20,760
Eraisha!

98
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:41,560
Who splashed water on me?

99
00:07:42,620 --> 00:07:43,620
Was it you guys?

100
00:07:44,220 --> 00:07:46,460
Must be nice, you guys can fly through the sky.

101
00:07:47,180 --> 00:07:49,020
Hey, won't you give me a ride and fly?

102
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,926
Off we go!

103
00:07:56,210 --> 00:07:58,282
Whoa, falling into the water!

104
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:08,407
Hi Sapphire!

105
00:08:08,700 --> 00:08:10,000
Tink, where are you going?

106
00:08:10,890 --> 00:08:12,680
I was just flying through the sky for a bit.

107
00:08:13,705 --> 00:08:15,060
It can't handle two people!

108
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:16,080
Time to switch!

109
00:08:16,180 --> 00:08:18,644
Whoa, this is great!

110
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:19,490
Fly!

111
00:08:19,670 --> 00:08:21,835
Fly higher!

112
00:08:24,060 --> 00:08:24,855
Hey!

113
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:27,275
Take me up higher!

114
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:29,240
Watch out!

115
00:08:30,344 --> 00:08:32,419
Go up higher!

116
00:08:32,443 --> 00:08:35,185
Sapphire look out!

117
00:08:35,500 --> 00:08:36,500
Sorry!

118
00:08:41,704 --> 00:08:45,543
Whoa, it's a pigsty!

119
00:08:48,603 --> 00:08:51,380
Sorry, sorry, I didn't know anyone was in here.

120
00:08:51,405 --> 00:08:54,163
Good grief, and after the trouble we went to building this house.

121
00:08:55,279 --> 00:08:56,540
It's not a pigsty?

122
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,700
What did you say?!

123
00:08:58,985 --> 00:09:02,242
It's not like we live in a house like this because we want to!

124
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:07,660
It's because a single soldier smashed the house we used to live in to pieces!

125
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,200
By a soldier?

126
00:09:09,289 --> 00:09:11,202
In the first place, just because Prince Sapphire wants a villa...

127
00:09:11,226 --> 00:09:14,913
 just because he wants one, our taxes are way higher than usual...

128
00:09:14,937 --> 00:09:17,420
and on top of that, they smashed our home to pieces!

129
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:19,660
It's the Prince Sapphire's fault!

130
00:09:20,039 --> 00:09:21,340
The Prince Sapphire is an idiot!

131
00:09:21,555 --> 00:09:23,000
It's the idiot prince's fault!

132
00:09:23,300 --> 00:09:23,700
That's a lie!

133
00:09:24,030 --> 00:09:25,710
I don't want a villa or anything like that!

134
00:09:26,119 --> 00:09:29,020
Lord Sapphire... Sapphire... Prince!

135
00:09:30,739 --> 00:09:31,639
That Duralumin guy...

136
00:09:32,358 --> 00:09:34,728
I wonder how far Sapphire has gone...

137
00:09:34,924 --> 00:09:37,947
It seems a demon is nearby...

138
00:09:37,979 --> 00:09:39,120
Opal, let's hurry and search for her!

139
00:09:41,025 --> 00:09:44,011
Lost, lost Sapphire!

140
00:10:01,189 --> 00:10:02,762
Arrogant...

141
00:10:03,364 --> 00:10:04,870
Eek, look at him acting so high and mighty...

142
00:10:09,789 --> 00:10:14,076
Ah, I'm in deep trouble... What am I gonna do...?
Please, just keep going, Opal...

143
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:17,616
Prince Sapphire's horse has returned!

144
00:10:17,641 --> 00:10:19,665
I have business with Duralumin...

145
00:10:19,689 --> 00:10:21,860
His Grace is away at the moment...

146
00:10:21,861 --> 00:10:23,102
Then I will have them wait inside...

147
00:10:23,127 --> 00:10:23,981
You mustn't enter.

148
00:10:25,010 --> 00:10:26,795
Please forgive me...

149
00:10:27,159 --> 00:10:28,838
Come on, don't hold back...

150
00:10:30,714 --> 00:10:33,721
Look at this place... towering up so grand and beautiful...

151
00:10:34,432 --> 00:10:35,705
The prince is here.

152
00:10:35,729 --> 00:10:37,596
What is he doing bringing strange people like that here...?

153
00:10:37,620 --> 00:10:40,240
That prince is becoming harder and harder to deal with...

154
00:10:40,241 --> 00:10:40,820
Why don't we just...?

155
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,960
Why don't we just...?

156
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,746
Have him taken care of...

157
00:10:43,770 --> 00:10:45,660
He's an assassin, after all...

158
00:10:45,684 --> 00:10:46,901
Absolutely not!

159
00:10:47,070 --> 00:10:48,680
I won't let anyone touch Sapphire!

160
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:49,760
W-Who's there?!

161
00:10:49,965 --> 00:10:51,300
Sapphire is mine!

162
00:10:52,055 --> 00:10:53,720
I won't let you have your way!

163
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:54,720
Who is it?!

164
00:10:54,920 --> 00:10:55,920
Come out!

165
00:11:03,349 --> 00:11:04,922
There you are, you monster!

166
00:11:05,270 --> 00:11:06,360
I am no monster!

167
00:11:06,825 --> 00:11:08,100
I am Mephisto, the Demon King!

168
00:11:08,715 --> 00:11:09,715
The Demon King, you say?

169
00:11:09,755 --> 00:11:11,400
What business do you have with Sapphire?

170
00:11:11,589 --> 00:11:14,239
If I transfer Sapphire's boy heart,

171
00:11:14,263 --> 00:11:16,820
my daughter Hecate can become a great witch!

172
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:19,221
Huh, you can really do that?

173
00:11:19,729 --> 00:11:20,900
I am the Demon King!

174
00:11:21,415 --> 00:11:22,415
I can do anything!

175
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:24,620
Aborexsi!

176
00:11:28,845 --> 00:11:30,943
What's this? Just a cheap parlor trick...

177
00:11:31,389 --> 00:11:32,480
Did you say it was foolish?

178
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:34,460
All right, how about this!

179
00:11:37,150 --> 00:11:40,713
All right! H-Help... I-I get it...

180
00:11:40,737 --> 00:11:42,141
Not yet!

181
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:44,232
Atarapusa!

182
00:11:54,050 --> 00:11:56,180
Well, do you understand my power now?

183
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:56,820
I understand!

184
00:11:57,160 --> 00:11:59,920
So, what happens to Sapphire if her boy's heart is taken?

185
00:12:00,430 --> 00:12:02,500
Naturally, she'll become just an ordinary girl!

186
00:12:02,855 --> 00:12:04,208
You mean she'll become just an ordinary woman!

187
00:12:04,700 --> 00:12:06,560
Duke, this is more than we could have ever wished for.

188
00:12:06,660 --> 00:12:09,162
If the prince becomes a woman, the throne will belong to Lord Plastic...

189
00:12:09,186 --> 00:12:11,120
Demon King, you are magnificent!

190
00:12:11,340 --> 00:12:13,100
We've decided to cooperate!

191
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,580
All right, then bring Sapphire here!

192
00:12:15,845 --> 00:12:16,946
I'll get her!

193
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,360
Grand Duke Duralumin!

194
00:12:18,590 --> 00:12:19,940
Even if you pretend not to be home, I can tell right away!

195
00:12:20,330 --> 00:12:21,600
Well, well, if it isn't the Prince.

196
00:12:21,760 --> 00:12:23,680
Please, right this way. We have a feast prepared for you.

197
00:12:24,504 --> 00:12:25,504
I didn't come here to be treated to a feast.

198
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,640
Why did you destroy these people's houses?

199
00:12:28,075 --> 00:12:31,820
Oh, about that, I was just about to bring them their relocation compensation.

200
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,400
Here, you can't have any complaints now, can you?!

201
00:12:34,209 --> 00:12:35,209
Leave at once!

202
00:12:35,405 --> 00:12:37,218
Thank you very much!

203
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:39,960
Please, right this way, the Duke is waiting for you.

204
00:12:44,539 --> 00:12:46,240
Nylon, where is the Duke?

205
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:48,480
Sapphire!

206
00:12:48,481 --> 00:12:49,340
Hold it right there!

207
00:12:49,365 --> 00:12:52,307
Don't just break into the castle!

208
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:55,000
This will be the end for the Prince.

209
00:12:55,789 --> 00:12:56,789
Grand Duke Duralumin!

210
00:12:56,950 --> 00:12:57,560
I need to talk to you!

211
00:12:57,660 --> 00:12:58,660
Come out!

212
00:13:01,595 --> 00:13:02,600
Get back!

213
00:13:18,100 --> 00:13:19,540
I've been waiting for you, Sapphire!

214
00:13:20,209 --> 00:13:22,860
I have waited a long time for this day to come!

215
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,380
What business do you have with me?

216
00:13:26,010 --> 00:13:29,340
I want that male heart of yours that even the Demon King fears!

217
00:13:29,341 --> 00:13:29,820
What?

218
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,820
Take it if you can!

219
00:13:40,170 --> 00:13:43,340
My body... won't move...

220
00:13:56,220 --> 00:13:58,260
Duke, it went well, didn't it?

221
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:00,760
Who could it be?

222
00:14:01,300 --> 00:14:03,060
When it matters most, no one is ever around!

223
00:14:05,455 --> 00:14:06,455
Sapphire!

224
00:14:08,209 --> 00:14:09,209
It's Sapphire!

225
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:10,280
Sapphire!

226
00:14:10,889 --> 00:14:12,420
What do you plan to do with Sapphire?!

227
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:13,780
What?

228
00:14:14,469 --> 00:14:15,600
My body is going numb!

229
00:14:16,739 --> 00:14:18,500
Hurry up and put Sapphire down!

230
00:14:18,525 --> 00:14:19,840
This guy is an angel!

231
00:14:25,300 --> 00:14:26,300
Look out!

232
00:14:32,809 --> 00:14:37,079
We were so close, but that Demon King is so useless...

233
00:14:37,103 --> 00:14:37,841
So useless?

234
00:14:38,115 --> 00:14:40,380
Getting in the way just for a brat like that!

235
00:14:40,639 --> 00:14:41,780
He is no ordinary brat!

236
00:14:42,220 --> 00:14:43,220
He is an angel!

237
00:14:43,530 --> 00:14:44,584
Is that an angel?

238
00:14:44,755 --> 00:14:46,960
Does it even suit the Great Demon King?

239
00:14:47,316 --> 00:14:47,875
Nylon!

240
00:14:47,899 --> 00:14:48,503
Yeah, yeah,

241
00:14:48,527 --> 00:14:49,778
Get your nose out of my face!

242
00:14:50,885 --> 00:14:52,920
Go take care of that brat yourself!

243
00:14:53,020 --> 00:14:54,020
Yes!

244
00:14:54,449 --> 00:14:56,500
Sapphire wake up.

245
00:14:57,135 --> 00:14:58,580
I'm going to get some water...

246
00:15:04,999 --> 00:15:06,155
Damn you!

247
00:15:15,219 --> 00:15:17,300
Even you're getting in the way over a single brat?!

248
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,020
Don't come near me!

249
00:15:19,300 --> 00:15:20,300
Go throw him away far, far away!

250
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:26,060
Well then, before we get interrupted again...

251
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:33,080
Oja, Hasha, Boinox Natsumora!

252
00:15:33,780 --> 00:15:36,900
Griffoirano Fai-yaa!

253
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:41,280
Fly all the way to my lair!

254
00:15:44,409 --> 00:15:45,800
Thanks for your help.

255
00:15:45,945 --> 00:15:46,945
Not at all.

256
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,784
Now the throne is ours.

257
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:02,880
Hang there and feed the vultures!

258
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,120
Draw!

259
00:16:11,439 --> 00:16:13,040
No good, I can't untie it.

260
00:16:13,475 --> 00:16:15,000
I wonder if Sapphire is okay?

261
00:16:19,579 --> 00:16:20,685
Someone nasty has arrived!

262
00:16:21,555 --> 00:16:22,780
Wh-What are you doing?!

263
00:16:23,285 --> 00:16:24,285
Darn it!

264
00:16:31,437 --> 00:16:33,512
Nasty bird!

265
00:16:38,739 --> 00:16:43,534
Decorasha, Tatarabosha, Natsumora!

266
00:16:43,900 --> 00:16:47,220
Amarasha, Oirus Trisshara!

267
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:50,020
Gakurogrishara!

268
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:53,280
Amaresha, Oirus Trisshara!

269
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:55,560
Urashoirusha!

270
00:17:03,340 --> 00:17:04,359
It's done!

271
00:17:04,599 --> 00:17:06,700
Now, Hecate, get back on that pedestal!

272
00:17:08,669 --> 00:17:12,339
Hecate, now you can become a fine witch too!

273
00:17:14,960 --> 00:17:21,339
Urarasha, Namoide, Amarasha, Oirus Trisshara!

274
00:17:27,293 --> 00:17:29,293
Mauling Faline!

275
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:31,920
Go away!

276
00:17:34,269 --> 00:17:35,269
Go away!

277
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:39,920
You little...!

278
00:17:47,449 --> 00:17:48,940
Grandpa! A shoe fell from the sky!

279
00:17:49,090 --> 00:17:50,090
Huh?

280
00:17:50,679 --> 00:17:51,894
Is someone up in that tree?

281
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:56,440
What should we do?

282
00:17:56,540 --> 00:17:58,720
If we don't help them... they're gonna die!

283
00:18:01,498 --> 00:18:03,519
You guys, cut over there!

284
00:18:05,320 --> 00:18:05,980
Idiot!

285
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:07,220
It's this tree!

286
00:18:11,384 --> 00:18:12,520
They came to save me!

287
00:18:23,001 --> 00:18:24,420
Yeah, this is good!

288
00:18:39,740 --> 00:18:41,640
We can't cross like this!

289
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:43,840
Right, let's cut that tree down and turn it into a bridge!

290
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:44,880
Let's do it!

291
00:18:51,149 --> 00:18:52,740
There, now you can cross with this, right?

292
00:18:52,940 --> 00:18:53,240
Right!

293
00:18:53,769 --> 00:18:56,680
Well, we can't go any further than this, so good luck out there!

294
00:18:56,700 --> 00:18:57,040
Good luck!

295
00:18:57,300 --> 00:18:58,300
Thanks!

296
00:19:18,171 --> 00:19:25,366
Uran-Bakin-Supanka, Amarasha, Dura-Dura, Amonamishara!

297
00:19:31,619 --> 00:19:33,120
Great Demon King!

298
00:19:33,420 --> 00:19:34,840
Grandeur of Hell!

299
00:19:35,459 --> 00:19:40,000
Now is the time, forgive me for using this method to change Hecate's heart!

300
00:19:43,119 --> 00:19:44,119
Sapphire!

301
00:19:44,520 --> 00:19:45,520
Angel!

302
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:47,060
Great Spirit!

303
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:52,800
This is the only way through!

304
00:19:53,539 --> 00:19:54,680
Alright!

305
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:56,200
Finish them off!

306
00:20:02,719 --> 00:20:03,719
There is is!

307
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:14,280
Hecate!

308
00:20:14,580 --> 00:20:15,580
Do something!

309
00:20:15,603 --> 00:20:17,603
Yakussak!

310
00:20:23,080 --> 00:20:24,080
Hecate!

311
00:20:24,279 --> 00:20:25,560
You failed, didn't you!

312
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:30,440
Don't come near me!

313
00:20:30,619 --> 00:20:31,840
Hecate, this is your fault!

314
00:20:32,159 --> 00:20:33,500
Do something about that pipsqueak!

315
00:20:45,109 --> 00:20:47,209
Pepei Jankuman!

316
00:20:54,921 --> 00:20:55,944
Samanya!

317
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,360
Give me that!

318
00:21:03,504 --> 00:21:04,504
Heave-ho!

319
00:21:04,779 --> 00:21:05,840
Heave-ho!

320
00:21:05,940 --> 00:21:06,940
This is no good!

321
00:21:14,768 --> 00:21:15,368
Demon!

322
00:21:15,460 --> 00:21:17,320
Even if you hide, I know right where you are!

323
00:21:19,899 --> 00:21:20,747
Oh, no!

324
00:21:24,509 --> 00:21:25,509
We did it!

325
00:21:28,660 --> 00:21:29,660
Sapphire!

326
00:21:33,380 --> 00:21:35,500
Tink... yeah, it's Tink!

327
00:21:36,020 --> 00:21:37,020
Where on earth are we?

328
00:21:37,299 --> 00:21:38,680
Alright, I'll teach you a lesson!

329
00:21:38,681 --> 00:21:39,681
Zuborasha!

330
00:21:41,860 --> 00:21:42,220
Ah!

331
00:21:42,850 --> 00:21:43,850
You're a demon, aren't you!

332
00:21:43,980 --> 00:21:44,980
I won't lose this time!

333
00:21:45,004 --> 00:21:46,818
It's not over yet!
Sapphire!

334
00:21:52,409 --> 00:21:53,409
Amarasha

335
00:21:56,429 --> 00:22:00,532
You horrifying monster that's grown huge!

336
00:22:07,249 --> 00:22:08,654
Watch out!

337
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:11,240
It's a monster!

338
00:22:19,559 --> 00:22:21,260
Alright, reinforcements!

339
00:22:33,084 --> 00:22:35,080
Get in there and eat them!

340
00:22:36,044 --> 00:22:37,044
I'm gonna win!

341
00:22:42,129 --> 00:22:43,260
Now I'm just acting out of desperation!

342
00:22:43,584 --> 00:22:44,740
Crumble, mountain!

343
00:22:47,900 --> 00:22:48,900
What's this?

344
00:22:55,685 --> 00:22:56,685
Uh oh!

345
00:23:00,349 --> 00:23:01,620
My body suddenly stopped moving!

346
00:23:07,079 --> 00:23:08,120
Sapphire!

347
00:23:08,529 --> 00:23:09,800
I wonder who saved us?

348
00:23:09,860 --> 00:23:10,120
Oh?

349
00:23:10,344 --> 00:23:13,560
Look at them over there... So Hecate saved them, didn't she!

350
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:16,460
Hecate!

351
00:23:16,725 --> 00:23:17,725
Come out in front of Papa!

352
00:23:18,584 --> 00:23:20,180
Why did you save them?

353
00:23:21,429 --> 00:23:23,446
I don't know why...

354
00:23:23,470 --> 00:23:25,940
 Papa is doing all this for your own good!

355
00:23:26,244 --> 00:23:29,660
I'm only doing this because I want you to get into a top-tier magic university!

356
00:23:30,179 --> 00:23:32,540
Don't you understand how your Papa feels?!

357
00:23:32,914 --> 00:23:36,699
I don't care if I don't become such a fine witch, Papa!

358
00:23:36,844 --> 00:23:38,520
What a thing to say, good grief!

359
00:23:38,769 --> 00:23:40,300
Talk about an ungrateful child!

360
00:23:40,599 --> 00:23:41,760
But I won't give up!

361
00:23:42,111 --> 00:23:42,612
Hey, you!

362
00:23:42,739 --> 00:23:45,600
Today might be my loss, but I will definitely win eventually!

363
00:23:45,900 --> 00:23:46,900
Just you wait!

364
00:23:51,079 --> 00:23:52,849
She really doesn't act like a witch...

365
00:23:52,873 --> 00:23:54,004
Some witch...

366
00:24:58,544 --> 00:25:00,544

